# Tulas International School — Homepage Redesign

A premium, modern, animated homepage redesign for Tulas International School (TIS), created as a frontend development assignment.

## 🌐 Live Website

https://tis-homepage-gray.vercel.app

## 📂 GitHub Repository

https://github.com/priiiyashu12/tis-homepage

## ✨ Features

* Premium modern school website design
* Responsive layout for desktop, tablet, and mobile
* Smooth scrolling and section-based navigation
* Animated UI interactions
* Campus and sports showcase
* Academics and student-life sections
* Rankings and testimonials
* Collaborations section
* Contact section with interactive form
* Admissions application modal
* Light / Dark theme toggle
* Responsive mobile navigation
* Custom cursor and scroll progress indicator
* Framer Motion animations
* Image-based cinematic sections with overlays

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

* Next.js
* React
* TypeScript
* Tailwind CSS
* Framer Motion
* Lucide React
* next-themes

