## 🚀 Getting Started

### Prerequisites

Make sure you have the following installed:

* Node.js
* npm

### Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/priiiyanshu12/tis-homepage.git
```

Navigate to the project directory:

```bash
cd tis-respository
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
npm install
```

Start the development server:

```bash
npm run dev
```

Open the project in your browser at:

```text
http://localhost:3000
```

## 📦 Production Build

To create a production build:

```bash
npm run build
```

To start the production server:

```bash
npm start
```

## 🎨 Design Approach

The redesign focuses on creating a premium and immersive school experience through:

* Cinematic full-width imagery
* Dark green and warm neutral visual palette
* Clean typography and spacious layouts
* Interactive navigation
* Smooth animations and transitions
* Section-based storytelling
* Responsive design across devices

The interface is designed to communicate TIS as a modern, student-focused institution while maintaining a sophisticated visual identity.

## 📱 Responsive Design

The website is optimized for:

* Desktop
* Laptop
* Tablet
* Mobile devices

The navigation, layouts, cards, forms, and interactive sections adapt to different screen sizes.

## 📝 Notes

* The contact form and admissions form are frontend demonstrations.
* No real form submission or backend database is connected.
* Some content such as testimonials and collaboration categories are presented as design/demo content.
* The project is developed as a frontend assignment and focuses primarily on UI, UX, responsiveness, animation, and component architecture.

